Change this file (any edit) to make the next deploy push supabase/config.toml
to Supabase even though config.toml and the seeds did not change.

config.toml reads its sign-in client IDs and secrets (DISCORD_*, GH_*, GOOGLE_*,
LINKEDIN_*) and BASE_URL* from the GitHub environment, so a rotated secret
reaches Supabase only when the config is pushed. See
docs/operations/credentials/ and docs/operations/deploys/one-approval.md.

last bump: 2026-10-13 (only showed the apply job runs when no migration is pending; staging has no SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN, so the config push itself was skipped there and has not run through the new scope anywhere)
